            "description": "",
            "summary": "In Asia, Tokyo\u2019s  closed 1.2% lower, with investors opting to take profit in tech stocks such as chip maker  Advantest  It was a similar story for Wall Street on Friday, as key laggards including six of the Magnificent Seven megacap tech stocks dragged down the broader market.  \u201cRisk assets are starting September on a more tentative footing as Friday\u2019s tech-led sell off on Wall Street has continued across most of Asia this morning,\u201d Deutsche Bank analyst Peter Sidorov said.  Hong Kong\u2019s  jumped 2.2%, though, after online retailer Alibaba reported a surge in revenue from artificial intelligence.",
